ami","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/accessibility(activationPoint:)-6fi1x":{"title":"accessibility(activationPoint:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/accessibility(activationpoint:)-6fi1x","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"accessibility"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"activationPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CGPoint","preciseIdentifier":"c:@S@CGPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ModifiedContent","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI15ModifiedContentV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AccessibilityAttachmentModifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI31AccessibilityAttachmentModifierV"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/accessibility(activationPoint:)-6fi1x","deprecated":true,"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/